  :createdAt 1789380000000
  :status "completed"
  :priorityOrder 2
  :summary "Test Regression Restoration & Assertion Integrity: restore all remaining failing test suites across the monorepo under strict-falsify (SVG compaction >=30%, reducer line splitting, git_search commit hash, StepResult observation, BM25 token counts, Option unwrap, zero-socket RPC, and search query encoding)."
  :phase "Phase476TestRegressionRestorationAndAssertionIntegrity"
  :baseline "Measured 2026-09-12 by monorepo audit. After Phase 475 foundation repairs, 15 discrete assertion logic and data mismatches remain across asl-codec, asl-sh, agent, mem, browser-plugin, web-api-search, and harness. Specific baseline failures: svg-transpile compaction is 27.42% (<30% gate); reducer line count is 5 (expected 4); git_search commit hash is empty; StepResult observation field is absent; vmm token division yields float 5.75; bm25 token count mismatch; hybrid search Pair wrapped in Option; visibility scope case matches closure; and test_parse_tags_test has 0 assertions."
